  "recap": "The Base Invaders put on a hitting clinic Thursday, August 13, cruising to a 27–0 win over Balls & Dolls. The offense never let up, racking up 27 hits and two home runs while eleven different players reached base along the way. Jason led the charge with a monster night at the plate, going 3-for-4 with a home run and 9 RBI, while Greg added a homer of his own and drove in 5 runs on a 2-for-5 day. Trevor stayed hot all game long, going 4-for-5 with 5 RBI, and Dillon chipped in 3-for-5 with 4 RBI to keep the line moving. Brendan rounded things out with a tidy 2-for-2, 2 RBI performance. It was a complete team effort from top to bottom, the kind of night where everyone in the lineup found a way to contribute.",
